<title>NORWAY: Fokus Bank 1996 pre-tax profits up.</title>
<headline>Fokus Bank 1996 pre-tax profits up.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31.</p>
<p>					(millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>  Net interest income		   912	vs	 959</p>
<p>  Other operating income		436	vs	 421</p>
<p>  Operating expenses		    969	vs	 959</p>
<p>  Op.res. before losses/writebacks  379	vs	 421</p>
<p>  Pre-tax operating profit	    462	vs	 429</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norway's third largest commercial bank is Fokus Bank ASA. A Reuter survey of seven analysts forecast pre-tax profits of 550 million crowns and net interest income at 917 million crowns. One of the analysts recommended to buy the share, four said hold and two said sell.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
